    <bpmn:process id="W_W3970" name="W3970. Competition Inquiry, Dawn Raid &amp; Information Request Response" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PCC information request, summons, or unannounced inspection (dawn raid)
Frequency: On event
Volume: Rare but high-impact
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Legal, Compliance, IT (links to VS-27), Records (links to VS-88), Security (links to VS-23), affected site leadership, external counsel, executive team
Source: workflow W3970 — Competition Inquiry, Dawn Raid &amp; Information Request Response</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3970_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3970_Lane1" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3970_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3970_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3970_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3970_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3970_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3970_Start3" name="PCC information request, summons, or unannounced inspection (dawn raid)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3970_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3970_Task4" name="VP Legal execute the dawn-raid plan on unannounced inspection: verify PCC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal execute the dawn-raid plan on unannounced inspection: verify PCC authority and scope, contact external counsel, manage staff conduct (courtesy, no obstruction, no destruction of documents), and document everything seized/requested
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Legal / Site Leadership
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: On event (immediate)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3970_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3970_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3970_Task5" name="VP Legal manage information requests/summonses: scope negotiation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Legal manage information requests/summonses: scope negotiation, privilege/log review, legal hold (links to VS-88), controlled production, and tracking
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Legal / Records / IT
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: On event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3970_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3970_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3970_Task6" name="VP Legal debrief, preserve lessons, brief the Board Audit Committee (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal debrief, preserve lessons, brief the Board Audit Committee (links to VS-36), and adjust controls/training (links to W3960/W3968)
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Post-event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3970_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3970_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3970_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3970_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-619 (ensure controlled execution — Competition Authority (PCC) Engagement, Investigation &amp; Remediation (PA-129.3).) | - operational: plan, training, and on-site leadership; operational: scope negotiation and log review
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3970_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3970_Annotation8" targetRef="W3970_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
