        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CFO/Legal quantify and provide for any PCC fine/penalty (up to PHP 250M first offense for a corporate offender; substantially more for repeat/large offenders under RA 10667) and any damages award/settlement; book the provision and contingency (links to VS-17.4 PFRS PAS 37)
