        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal translate any PCC commitment/order, settlement obligation, or conduct-change remedy into a remediation plan: clause amendments, conduct changes, training (links to W3960), control changes (W3961–W3966), and structural/divestiture remedies if imposed
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Compliance / affected BU
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: On event</bpmn:documentation>
