    <bpmn:process id="W_W3976" name="W3976. Competition Compliance Program Analytics, Reporting &amp; Board Oversight" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Board/Audit Committee cadence; annual program review
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Enterprise program reporting
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Participants: Legal, Compliance, Data/Analytics (links to VS-28), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), CEO, Board Audit/Risk Committee
Source: workflow W3976 — Competition Compliance Program Analytics, Reporting &amp; Board Oversight</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3976_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3976_Lane1" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3976_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3976_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3976_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3976_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3976_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3976_Start3" name="Board/Audit Committee cadence; annual program review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3976_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3976_Task4" name="VP Legal/Analytics compile program analytics: risk-coverage %, training…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal/Analytics compile program analytics: risk-coverage %, training completion, control-testing pass rate, association-meeting reports filed, contract-clause reviews completed, monitoring anomalies, PCC engagements, incidents, remediation status, and KPI trends
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Analytics / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3976_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3976_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3976_Task5" name="VP Legal report to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to VS-36 governance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Legal report to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to VS-36 governance and VS-21.2 ERM), flag emerging risks (PCC guidance, market changes, M&amp;A pipeline links to VS-130), and seek direction on risk appetite
Responsible (R): VP Legal / CEO
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3976_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3976_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3976_Task6" name="VP Legal run the annual program review (effectiveness, resourcing, maturity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal run the annual program review (effectiveness, resourcing, maturity benchmarking against PCC/ISO 37001-style expectations), secure budget, and iterate the strategy (links to W3953)
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3976_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3976_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3976_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3976_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-619 (ensure controlled execution — Competition Authority (PCC) Engagement, Investigation &amp; Remediation (PA-129.3).) | - operational: structured quarterly reporting; operational: annual review and benchmarking
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
